React Tic-Tac-Toe Application
1. Completed Application
Project Title: Tic-Tac-Toe Game
Description:
A responsive Tic-Tac-Toe game developed using React. The application allows two players to play against each other by taking turns placing X and O on a 3×3 board. The game automatically detects winning combinations, draws, and keeps track of scores across multiple rounds.
Implemented Features:
•	Interactive 3×3 game board 
•	Player turn switching between X and O 
•	Winner detection 
•	Draw detection 
•	Highlighting of winning squares 
•	Round restart functionality 
•	Complete match reset functionality 
•	Score tracking for X, O, and draws 
•	Responsive design for different screen sizes 
Technologies Used:
•	React.js 
•	JavaScript (ES6) 
•	CSS / Inline Styling 
•	Vite React Development Environment 
